  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing smallholder strategies for Fall Armyworm (FAW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agreement between Norad and International Centre for Research in Agroforestry (ICRAF) regarding the research project RAF-18/0013 &quot;Developing Smallholder Strategies for Fall Armyworms (FAW) ) (Spodoptera Frugiperda) Management in Southern Africa: Examining the Effectiveness of Ecological Control options&quot;. The national implementation partners in the project are Zambia Agricultural Research Institute (ZARI) and Department of Agricultural Research Services (DARS) in Zambia and Malawi respectively.</narrative>
  </description>
